  "prefLabel": "Frl 404.01 Conducting of Funeral",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-09-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 404.01 Conducting of Funeral. No funeral director shall permit or request a person, who is not licensed by the board as a funeral director or apprentice embalmer to arrange, prearrange, conduct, direct or supervise a funeral.\n\nSource. #1689, eff 12-22-80; ss by#2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88; amd by #4937, eff 9-24-90, EXPIRED: 9-24-96\n\nNew. #10548, eff 3-21-14",
